  "steps": [
    "Roast dailya for 4-5 mins in 1 tsp ghee.",
    "Add water and cover the pan. Let it cook on low flame until its soft and mushy. Takes 5-10 mins. Don’t let it become too dry, it should be wet and mushy so you can easily roll into balls.",
    "Add Rice flour, cardamom powder, saffron infused water, sweetner, food color and raisins. Also add 1 tbsp ghee at this stage.",
    "Sauté for 2 minutes. Turn off the flame and let it cool down. The mixture should be sticky and have a starchy texture.",
    "Apply ghee on your palms and starting rolling into laddus. Garnish with pistachios/ cashews and dig in."
  ],
